# Real client dirs carry PII (names, numbers, photos) and stay out of git, same rule as
# ai-receptionist/config/clients/. Only the fake fixture is tracked.
clients/*
!clients/voorbeeld-dakdekker/
!clients/voorbeeld-preview/
# The locatie counterpart to the dakdekker fixture, and equally fictional. Tracked so the
# register has a worked example in the repo and not only in someone's working copy.
!clients/voorbeeld-kapper-rotterdam/
dist/
.astro/
# Fleet fingerprints (scripts/vloot.mjs) hold a site's rendered copy, so they follow the
# clients/ rule exactly: a real client's text never enters git, and the tracked fixtures
# are kept so a fresh checkout has something to measure a new site against.
vloot/*
!vloot/voorbeeld-dakdekker.json
!vloot/voorbeeld-preview.json
!vloot/voorbeeld-kapper-rotterdam.json
# Search scratch for `stock-photos.py zoek`: two dozen unpicked frames per vak, worth
# nothing once the seven are pinned in stock/sets/. The recipe is the artefact, not this.
stock/kandidaten/
